WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.610 --> 00:00:02.610
The truth is rarely pure.

00:00:03.549 --> 00:00:06.509
There is a rumor within the church. It goes like this:

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:11.490
Long ago, a party of knights and priests, journeyed into the Valley of Defilement.

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:15.240
The Valley is home to everything humanity wants to forget...

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:19.640
Outcasts, the deformed, the despised, and the aborted.

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:24.840
The party of knights sent there never returned, and the leader of the party, the Maiden Astraea, is

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:26.840
said to have become a demon.

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:30.150
Demons take many forms; though all fall into three categories.

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:38.099
There are minor demons. There are major demons. And, there are archdemons. All demons can be likened to the roots of a tree,

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:43.799
spreading through an area and gathering souls just as a tree would gather nutrients.

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:49.829
At the core of Demon-kind is the Old One, an ancient being that sent its demon's with one purpose:

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:51.980
gather more souls.

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:57.300
If we can take out the Archdemons, we will prove ourselves as the most powerful demon of all...

00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:04.260
This will open a path to the old one, for the old one needs powerful demons to gather his souls. Once close,

00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:06.809
we can put the old one back to his slumber,

00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:09.239
instead of becoming his demon.

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:16.140
The old one is spreading a Demon fog, a fog filled with demons and a fog that turns things into demons

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:18.659
The fog has touched the Valley of Defilement.

00:01:18.729 --> 00:01:24.599
It is here where lepers, the poisoned, the plate and the deformed are banished to live out their days in agony

00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:27.839
Not just the living are sent here, but the dead.

00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:31.019
Aborted babies can be found at the base of the river

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:37.890
all the foulness of the world runs into this place, the denizens of which struggle inside of the impurity

00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:41.579
The poor dwellers are gaunt, infested and filthy yet

00:01:41.579 --> 00:01:48.539
They're adapted with masks spouting long beaks packed with aromatic herbs and spices that must offer some small respite

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:53.280
What exists there would be enough to challenge the Faith of the most devout heart.

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:56.850
Somehow, humanity struggles on within this place.

00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:04.710
food for the giant ticks, the leeches, the mosquitoes, the rats. The most impure being of all resides at the center of the Valley.

00:02:04.960 --> 00:02:09.509
A woman turned Demon who apparently turned on her fellow knights and protectors.

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:15.050
Upon hearing these rumors the church sends some of its best knights into the valley to discover the truth.

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:23.089
Vito the Moonlight Knight, Lizaia of Istarel, and Selen Vinland.

00:02:24.390 --> 00:02:30.110
Many honorable Knights have ventured into Boletaria in search of the Valley of Defilement.

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:38.989
The vicious rumors about Astraea offend our most basic sense of respect for God's name.

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:41.670
However,

00:02:41.670 --> 00:02:45.229
none of these great knights has made it back.

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:54.049
Could it be that the wretched Valley is so infested with grime that even our Lord's voice does not resonate there?

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:56.640
Or,

00:02:56.640 --> 00:03:00.619
perhaps it is the fate of those left behind by God

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:02.959
We find the corpse of Bito,

00:03:02.959 --> 00:03:08.869
covered in slugs and fallen to the valley. Above the Leechmonger is also Lizaia's wooden spear.

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:16.160
She presumably fell below to be consumed by leeches. People whisper that these adventurers fell at the Demon Astraea's hand

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:21.109
Ever since that Demon which came here everything has turned foul.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:29.209
All the men worship her like she's the Virgin Mary, the same men who would snatch my child away from me!

00:03:29.670 --> 00:03:32.720
This was a much better place before she came.

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:41.690
Astraea is indeed the Archdemon at the center of the Valley, though while the Valley brims with grime, it also feels strangely pure.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:46.759
But the last knight we sent into the swamp still lives, and we find her here now.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:53.059
Why, you are one of the sane ones, are you not? I am Selen of the West.

00:03:53.609 --> 00:03:55.609
I seek my brother, Garl Vinland.

00:03:55.739 --> 00:03:58.909
The knight who accompanied Saint Astraea on her travels.

00:03:59.489 --> 00:04:01.260
I believe they settled here.

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:07.730
If you happen to see my younger brother, please tell me. I must share with him the last words of our father.

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:13.459
I heard an unflattering rumor about Saint Astraea. Have you met that herb peddling woman?

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:18.289
She claims that Saint Astraea is herself a demon.

00:04:18.989 --> 00:04:20.989
That woman has no reason to lie.

00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:23.850
Surely she must be mistaken.

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:31.799
I find something odd about this place. It brims with grime, but at once feels strangely pure.

00:04:33.070 --> 00:04:34.980
Selen holds the Ring of Devout Prayer,

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:41.279
which she intends to give to her brother. It is the sister ring to the Ring of Sincere Prayer, a holy relic that

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:44.850
increases the power of miracles. When Astraea was a young girl,

00:04:44.850 --> 00:04:47.100
she found the Ring of Sincere Prayer,

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:50.820
a discovery that instantly propelled her into sainthood. The ring,

00:04:50.820 --> 00:04:56.670
they said, was a revelation of God, a sign that God himself had chosen the girl for great things.

00:04:57.250 --> 00:05:00.809
When Astraea became a saint, she took on the knight Garl Vinland.

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:08.460
Garl was a night of the Vinland family, a powerful family within the church and likely a friend of Astraea since their childhood.

00:05:09.010 --> 00:05:12.959
He was to serve as her bodyguard, and whether or not he was more than a friend,

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:16.380
he served her loyally and the two remained inseparable.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:23.009
It's common for the people of the church to embark on pilgrimage, a journey of spiritual significance or awakening.

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:26.369
When Astraea learned of the suffering within the Valley of Defilement,

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:31.439
she embarked on a pilgrimage to search for it. When she and her knights found the valley,

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:36.989
she must have seen a land abandoned by God, full of suffering and those who were to be forgotten.

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:40.919
This filthy woman tells us that Astraea made things worse,

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:45.629
but she is simply jealous of Astraea, for before Astraea came,

00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:50.519
the filthy woman was the apple of every man's eye. In truth, Astraea

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:57.180
did great good in the Valley. Her heart was broken by the plight of the depraved, and she cared for them and healed them, and

00:05:57.280 --> 00:06:02.580
they worshipped her as a christ-like figure, for she cared for them when no one else would.

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:07.019
So by the time the Demon fog rolled over the world and through the Valley of Defilement,

00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:12.000
Astraea had changed. The Valley had stripped her of any belief in her God.

00:06:12.190 --> 00:06:17.369
How could a benevolent God allow these people to suffer. The church wasn't worshipping

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:21.570
God, it was more like they were worshipping the devil. So she made a decision.

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:28.859
Instead of fighting the Demon fog, Astraea embraced it, becoming the first human to successfully weather the

00:06:29.229 --> 00:06:34.509
transformation into Demon. She kept her sanity, her personality and her form.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:39.399
The only one of her party of knights to live was Garl, a lifelong friend.

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:44.769
He decided to stay with her until the end. Her demon power was not used for great evil.

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:48.880
She tried to use it for good. She resurrected the aborted children of the valley,

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:55.359
she created a sanctuary for the lost and the wretched and she tried to cleanse the most vile place in the world.

00:06:55.640 --> 00:07:02.619
As an Archdemon, she needed to gather souls for the old one, so whenever a traveler or knight came into the valley to discover

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:08.530
what was going on, the depraved travelers would murder him and bring the traveler's soul to Astraea.

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:11.920
Truth is, Astraea is a beacon of hope.

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:18.459
She is our only example, that those with a powerful Demon soul are capable of using evil for good works, and

00:07:18.890 --> 00:07:23.949
given time, the perception of Demons could change. As Sage Freke the visionary says,

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:27.879
Astrae has proven that humans can evolve to a higher state.

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:34.330
Yet to us, she is an archdemon, and from our narrow perspective, she must die.

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:37.930
Leave us, Slayer of Demons.

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:42.969
This is a sanctuary for the lost and wretched.

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:47.649
There is nothing here for you to pillage or plunder.

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:51.339
Please, leave quietly.

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:55.030
You will not turn back, will you?

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:59.379
How dare you persist that intruding upon our haven?

00:08:01.340 --> 00:08:05.229
You abandoned us long ago. What right do you have?

00:08:07.190 --> 00:08:10.540
We live humble lives. Leave us be.

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:14.890
I shall let no harm come to dearest Astraea.

00:08:16.550 --> 00:08:19.570
May you rot in the deepest depths of this swamp.

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:23.680
Cruel Lord,

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:27.899
what more can you possibly take from us? Stop.

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:36.219
Please stop. This is our home.

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:41.409
We have done no harm to you.

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:45.490
Dear God,

00:08:45.529 --> 00:08:47.529
have mercy.

00:08:48.020 --> 00:08:51.939
Is not your abandonment of us punishment enough?

00:08:53.209 --> 00:08:57.279
How long must we weather this cruel fate?

00:08:58.610 --> 00:09:01.000
Ye covetous ones, let it be known.

00:09:02.899 --> 00:09:06.039
We shall defend our heart and home to the death.

00:09:10.970 --> 00:09:15.210
Dearest Astraea. I have failed you.

00:09:22.170 --> 00:09:26.089
You... you killed him, didn't you?

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:31.100
Very well, I can no longer resist you.

00:09:32.759 --> 00:09:38.509
Do as you like, take your precious demon soul.

00:09:46.029 --> 00:09:47.309
Just like Astraea,

00:09:47.309 --> 00:09:54.569
we committed an evil in the name of good. We kill an archdemon in order to rid humanity of the old one and his demons.

00:09:55.269 --> 00:09:58.469
Yet, Astraea was the Demon using her power for good.

00:09:59.230 --> 00:10:04.379
So ask yourself, Slayer of Demons, do the ends justify the means?

